WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.300
If there is tape, keep the area dry until three

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.740
days after surgery.

3
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.620
Do not clean the incision before that time.

4
00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:12.300
If there is no tape, clean the edges of the incision

5
00:00:12.369 --> 00:00:13.820
gently twice a day.

6
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.340
Use a mix of equal parts hydrogen peroxide

7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:18.700
and distilled water.

8
00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:22.780
Then apply an over-the-counter antibiotic ointment,

9
00:00:22.828 --> 00:00:24.140
such as bacitracin.
